{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a peculiar world. Nothing seems to make sense. You quickly realize that even in here, money still makes the world go round. Let's get to work, shall we?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things start getting weirder by the day. It's as if you've seen these before. Or have you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, like everyone else - just sweeping the streets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a business owner, with all the advantages and disadvantages that it brings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of the random opportunities that arise every day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend some money on yourself - people need to know what a great car you drive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Hmm, and what about those collection items?</span>\u00a0<i>no, don't listen to him! those don't matter at all, just throw them out!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>10/10</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>i'd rather click on the broom than doom-scroll TikTok</i> - a friend of mine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>what's the matter with this government? i bought ghereta, after assiduously sweeping the streets, and all of a sudden my taxes went up</i> - another friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(and yes, the logos are off-center, you're welcome)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps","path"